/* ---------- Tutorials ---------- */
"game.airHockey.tutorial" = "Lay the phone flat between you. Each of you defends the goal at the bottom of your side.\n\nSlide your finger in your half to move your mallet. Hit the puck into the opponent's goal. First to 7 goals wins.\n\nYour mallet never crosses the centre line.";
"game.chess.tutorial" = "Classic chess, face to face. White plays from the bottom, Black from the top, upright for each player.\n\nTap one of your pieces to see its legal moves, then tap the destination. Castling, en passant and promotion are handled for you.\n\nCheckmate the opponent's king to win.";
"game.draughts.tutorial" = "International draughts, on a 10-by-10 board. White at the bottom, Black at the top.\n\nTap a piece, then a free dark square. Capturing is mandatory: when captures exist, you must play the longest one. A piece reaching the far row becomes a king that flies along the whole diagonal.\n\nCapture all the opponent's pieces to win.";
"game.tron.tutorial" = "Two light cycles, one arena. Each of you steers from your half.\n\nSwipe in a direction to turn. Your cycle leaves a trail behind it. Don't hit a wall, a trail, or the other cycle.\n\nLast one riding wins.";
"game.mill.tutorial" = "Nine Men's Morris, on three linked squares. Each of you has nine pieces.\n\nFirst, take turns placing your pieces on the intersections. Then move them along the lines. Lining up three forms a mill, letting you remove one of the opponent's pieces.\n\nReduce the opponent to two pieces, or block them, to win.";

